  "description": "Save the Date Embroidery Design – Wedding Heart Stitch with Floral Details (3 Sizes)\nMake your special announcement even more memorable with this elegant Save the Date embroidery design. Featuring beautiful cursive script, floral accents, and a romantic heart outline, it’s perfect for wedding gifts, keepsakes, bridal shower decor, or even stitched onto napkins, pillows, or totes for your big day!\n💍 Script style text with soft curves\n🌸 Adorned with dainty flower motifs\n💙 Heart outline wrapping around the message\n📏 Comes in 3 sizes for versatile projects\nWhether you’re planning your own wedding or crafting a thoughtful handmade gift, this design adds a lovely touch to every stitch.\nThe following formats are included in the file you will receive:\n* PES – (Brother, Deco, Babylock)\n* DST – (Tajima)\n* EXP – (Melco)\n* HUS – (Husqvarna,Viking)\n*VP3 – (Husqvarna, Viking)\n*VIP\n* ХХХ\n* SEW – (Janome, Elna, Kenmore)",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Save the Date Embroidery Design – Wedding Heart Stitch with Floral Details (3 Sizes)</p>\n<p>Make your special announcement even more memorable with this elegant Save the Date embroidery design. Featuring beautiful cursive script, floral accents, and a romantic heart outline, it’s perfect for wedding gifts, keepsakes, bridal shower decor, or even stitched onto napkins, pillows, or totes for your big day!</p>\n<p>💍 Script style text with soft curves<br>\n🌸 Adorned with dainty flower motifs<br>\n💙 Heart outline wrapping around the message<br>\n📏 Comes in 3 sizes for versatile projects</p>\n<p>Whether you’re planning your own wedding or crafting a thoughtful handmade gift, this design adds a lovely touch to every stitch.</p>\n<p>The following formats are included in the file you will receive:<br>\n* PES – (Brother, Deco, Babylock)<br>\n* DST – (Tajima)<br>\n* EXP – (Melco)<br>\n* HUS – (Husqvarna,Viking)<br>\n*VP3 – (Husqvarna, Viking)<br>\n*VIP<br>\n* ХХХ<br>\n* SEW – (Janome, Elna, Kenmore)</p>",
